{"id":"0815358d5b1d8115","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-provable-truth.md","title":"可证真理","display":"df-provable-truth — 可证真理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-provable-truth","aliases":["91-df-provable-truth","91-df-proof-theoretic-truth","91-df-truth-from-provability"],"display":"df-provable-truth — 可证真理","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-provable-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-provable-truth</span><span>91-df-proof-theoretic-truth</span><span>91-df-truth-from-provability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable-truth — 可证真理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-provable-truth-—-可证真理-$\\mathrm{ProvTrue}$\">df-provable-truth — 可证真理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvTrue}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvTrue}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (递归公理化理论)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> (具有标准句法编码并解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的结构)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\">\\(\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\)</span> 是下述分别定义的模型真句集与可证真句集；理论、模型、真理谓词及编码均取上述固定环境。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\mid S\\vdash\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\mid\n\\mathfrak M\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\mid S\\vdash\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\mid\n\\mathfrak M\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\cap\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\cap\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\)</span> 且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\\)</span>；\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\subseteq\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\subseteq\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\\)</span>，则前者等于\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvTrue}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvTrue}\\)</span> : 可证且真的句子集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的可证句集合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}\\)</span> : 声性假设</li>\n</ul>\n<p>可证真理的意义：\n在有声性假设下，可证句子都是真的。</p>\n<p>可证真理与不一致情况：\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不一致，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\)</span> 包含所有句子；若同时假定一个一致且正确处理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\\)</span>，就会与该真理理论冲突。</p>\n<p>可证真理的形式化：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\to T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\to T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n<td>单个声性实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\land T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\land T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 属于可证真理集的条件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>可证真理与真理理论的关联：\n具体理论证明哪些声性实例取决于其组合公理、规则和归纳强度；不把这些理论性结论写入集合定义。特别地，逐句 T-双条件不自动给出统一声性句。</p>\n<p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连接可证性与真理</li>\n<li>区分形式证明与真理性</li>\n<li>理解反射原则的作用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-provable-truth-—-可证真理-$\\mathrm{ProvTrue}$","text":"df-provable-truth — 可证真理 $\\mathrm{ProvTrue}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvTrue}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\mid S\\vdash\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\mid\n\\mathfrak M\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\cap\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\subseteq\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvTrue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\to T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\land T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":2678,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-provable-truth]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-com